tlite

Tamper-evident tables for SQLite.

tlite records changes to chosen SQLite tables in an append-only
Merkle log, in the same file. Checkpoints use the C2SP signed-note
format and can be time-stamped (RFC 3161). Anyone can verify an
exported bundle offline.

Status: early. Not usable yet.

Plan: see PLAN.
